A==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **Current clinical picture**\nYou’re reporting stress, tiredness, and episodes where your heartbeat feels unusually strong or fast. From your stored health context, I also see a history of **hypertension**, treatment with **lisinopril** and **amlodipine**, and prior kidney-related follow-up, which makes heartbeat symptoms worth checking a bit carefully.\n\n**Preliminary interpretation**\nThis pattern could fit **stress-related palpitations**, fatigue from poor sleep or overload, **caffeine/stimulant effects**, or sometimes a heart rhythm issue that would need closer review. Because you also have a blood pressure history, I don’t want to over-assume this is “just stress,” especially if the pounding heartbeat is new, frequent, prolonged, or comes with **chest pain, shortness of breath, dizziness, or fainting**.\n\n**Recommended questions**\nTo narrow this down safely, please answer this first:\n**(1/4)** When these pounding-heart episodes happen, **how long do they last**, and do you notice **chest pain, shortness of breath, dizziness, or near-fainting** with them?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e230605dcec22620169d92da776008191b73c3d5a9a4f9427\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8853,"output":365,"cacheRead":9984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19202,"cost":{"input":0.022132500000000003,"output":0.005475,"cacheRead":0.002496,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030103500000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775840670709}}
